{"4632350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hot Dogs, Horseshoes & Hand Grenades 2", "steam_appid": 4632350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are The Handy. Part field engineer. Part tactical operator. All Beef. Arm yourself and deploy into an endlessly reconfiguring megastructure that’s slowly tearing itself apart. You’re the right meat for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a loadout. Deploy to the Facility. Fight its denizens. Loot what you can. Extract to your base. Build your armory. Each run makes you stronger than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run of the procedurally-generated Facility brings new surprises. Unlock new gear, challenges, and upgrades as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H3VR2 continues the original’s spirit of experimentation and letting you choose how to play. New to firearms, virtual or otherwise? Our Certification Range is here to train you up. Looking for intense Competition, chill Arcade Shooting, or aimless Sandbox vibes, we’ve got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought VR guns couldn’t get any better, we’ve gone and done it again. MORE realism. MORE complex gun handling. MORE ballistics depth. MORE authentic audio. MORE opportunities to configure your perfect shooting experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/54dadd66ed9da124d557fa6379a4d52d.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are The Handy. Part field engineer. Part tactical operator. All Beef. Arm yourself and deploy into an endlessly reconfiguring megastructure that’s slowly tearing itself apart. You’re the right meat for the job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/4fd16f735d511e8d4b9a0c16c4bb4b49.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a loadout. Deploy to the Facility. Fight its denizens. Loot what you can. Extract to your base. Build your armory. Each run makes you stronger than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/a5e881b2253afe70cece11b2569c2b4c.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run of the procedurally-generated Facility brings new surprises. Unlock new gear, challenges, and upgrades as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/1dbebb1ac96a9366f2aa180a6653657f.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >H3VR2 continues the original’s spirit of experimentation and letting you choose how to play. New to firearms, virtual or otherwise? Our Certification Range is here to train you up. Looking for intense Competition, chill Arcade Shooting, or aimless Sandbox vibes, we’ve got you covered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.poster.avif?t=1778085781\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.webm?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/extras/69cf775d974ec4b0543686240c2de541.mp4?t=1778085781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just when you thought VR guns couldn’t get any better, we’ve gone and done it again. MORE realism. MORE complex gun handling. MORE ballistics depth. MORE authentic audio. MORE opportunities to configure your perfect shooting experience.</p>", "short_description": "Shoot, loot, and scoot as a sentient hot dog in the sequel to Hot Dogs, Horseshoes &amp; Hand Grenades (H3VR), the award-winning, best-selling Immersive FPS. Master an arsenal of the best guns in VR. Fight your way through an endless proc-gen megastructure. Chill out and plink on the range. Wonderful!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4632350/9af3058a13e2b2eea1ac585d8a343f16809760c8/header.jpg?t=1778085781", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/